## 4. Claim Audit (per `AUDIT_PROTOCOL.md` §2)

| ID | Claim (from abstract) | Tested? | Result | Notes |
|----|----|---|---|---|
| C1 | Stochastic NHEJ on PARTRAC spatial input reproduces biphasic (fast+slow) DSB rejoining curve | **Qualitative** | **Verified qualitatively** | Scenario A reproduces fast initial drop + slow long-time tail (fig 1); we substituted uniform DSB input for PARTRAC (documented) |
| C2 | Pre-synaptic parameters derived from Ku/DNA-PK assoc/dissoc data | **Not tested** | n/a | The actual paper's `k_on`/`k_off` values are not in the abstract; we used fit-from-rejoining rather than fit-from-protein-kinetics |
| C3 | Post-synaptic time constants fitted to ¹³⁷Cs γ DSB rejoining in human fibroblasts | **Qualitative** | **Verified qualitatively** | We tuned `k_clean`, `k_dirty_step` to recover the literature biexponential (fig 1, Scenario A); identical fitting *target*, different fitting *method* |
| C4 | Three of four scenarios overestimate residual DSBs at long times after low-dose IR | **Qualitative** | **Verified qualitatively** | We do not have the paper's four scenarios. We do show that of our two scenarios, one (B, diffusive) badly overestimates residuals (fig 2). Direction-of-effect matches the abstract claim. |
| C5 | Mis-rejoined DSBs vs dose match measurements "surprisingly well" | **Cannot test quantitatively** | n/a | The paper's mis-rejoin numbers vs dose are paywalled. Forster 2019 (proxy) gives α_mr=0.02 Gy⁻¹, β_mr=0.37 Gy⁻² for HNSCC at r₀=0.7 µm; our Scenario-B mis-rejoin rises super-linearly with dose, qualitatively consistent with α+βD² shape, but quantitative comparison to Friedland 2010 numbers is impossible. |
| C6 | Chromosomal aberrations vs dose match measurements "surprisingly well" | **Not tested** | n/a | We do not implement chromosome territory geometry; mis-rejoin count is at best a proxy |
| C7 | Dirty ends are the source of the slow rejoining component | **Qualitative** | **Verified qualitatively** | In our model, setting `p_dirty=0` collapses the slow tail to noise; setting `p_dirty=0.3` and `n_dirty_steps≥4` produces the slow phase. The mechanism is identical to the abstract's claim by construction. (Note: this is partly tautological — we *built* the model to behave this way because the abstract says so.) |

**Tally:** 0 quantitatively verified, 4 qualitatively verified, 0 contradicted, 3 not testable from accessible material.

**Claim-coverage fraction:** 4 / 7 qualitative ≈ **57%** qualitative coverage; **0 / 7** quantitative coverage. Per `AUDIT_PROTOCOL.md` §2 threshold (≥80%), this **fails the "done" bar**.

